<title>THAILAND: Thai bourse suspends banks, finance shares.</title>
<headline>Thai bourse suspends banks, finance shares.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's stock exchange said on Monday it had suspended trading in all banks and finance and securities company shares until further notice.</p>
<p>Earlier, the bourse said it had halted trading in the two sectors in the morning session.</p>
<p>The suspension was because a central bank and finance ministry clarification of measures to help the finance sector was awaited, it added.</p>
</text>
